You do NOT need to post daily.
One good post per month is enough.
✅ Example post you can use later
Working on real production OCR + LLM systems has reinforced how important AI reliability is.

Confidence scoring and human-in-the-loop validation are far more critical in enterprise AI than model hype.

This signals:

maturity
real‑world experience
system thinking


